      "source": "# Manim Jupyter 示例\n\n这个 Notebook 演示当前开发版的典型用法：Typst 数学、Python 辅助 Cell 和 Manim 动画。\n\n行内公式 $sum_(k=1)^n k = (n(n + 1)) / 2$，块级公式如下：\n\n$$ integral_0^infinity e^(-x^2) dif x = sqrt(pi) / 2 $$",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "source": "def make_axes():\n    return Axes(\n        x_range=[-3, 3, 1],\n        y_range=[-2, 2, 1],\n    )",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterCellType": "python"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "execution_count": null
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "source": "axes = make_axes()\ngraph = axes.plot(lambda x: x ** 2, color=YELLOW)\nself.play(Create(axes))\nself.play(Create(graph))",
      "metadata": {
